# (envelope fix round, HEAD, softcap.py) D55: the hero lines' T2 (TANNER'S) soft
# cap: a soft leather crown 3 rows over the crown line (F-34), lit top-left with one shine, over a rolled brim (its lit
# roll and shadowed underside) 1 px past the head box; no ear flaps, no metal; the hair's fringe shows under the brim.
# Drawn before the old T2 views, so it wins on TANNER'S (`forge-tanner`); the old views keep their pixels for the rest.
view D key rest origin 2 3 when helm.t2,!helm.t3,!bow,forge-tanner replace
